never leaves the weights tent.","isLiar":true,"statements":["I was lifting the anvil in the weights tent all evening.","I heard the calliope stop at the second bell.","The Ringmaster owed me three weeks of wages."]},{"name":"Madame Twist","id":"contortionist","profile":"Contortionist. Speaks only in whispers. Fiercely loyal to the Ringmaster.","isLiar":false,"statements":["I was rehearsing in the mirror room.","The mirror room door squeaks; anyone would have heard me.","I saw Bruno near the caravans."]},{"name":"Lady Ash","id":"fireeater","profile":"The fire-eater. Has never been seen without her veil.","isLiar":true,"statements":["I was at the candy floss stand the whole time.","The candy floss machine broke at the second bell.","I never go near the big top after dark."]},{"name":"Old Zelda","id":"fortune","profile":"Fortune teller. Claims to have foreseen the disappearance.","isLiar":false,"statements":["I was reading cards for a couple from out of town.","My lantern was lit the entire evening.","The cards warned me about the third bell."]},{"name":"The Great Valentino","id":"knife","profile":"Knife thrower. Arrogant. Never misses - or so he says.","isLiar":true,"statements":["I was sharpening knives in my wagon.","My assistant was with me the whole time.","I have not spoken to the Ringmaster in days."]},{"name":"Silent Pete","id":"organ","profile":"Plays the calliope. Rarely speaks, always hums.","isLiar":false,"statements":["I played the calliope until the second bell.","I stopped because a key jammed.","I saw Lady Ash go into the big top."]}],"title":"The Vanishing Ringmaster","rules":"Question each performer in character. Performers must answer every question but may refuse to touch their props. No more than two questions in a row to the same performer."},{"partialCredit":true,"id":"poisoned_floss","description":"Someone dyed the candy floss black and the whole crowd turned green. Six stall-holders handled the sugar. Three of them are lying.","perfectBonus":20,"clues":[{"text":"A receipt for black food dye was found in the paint store.","id":"c1"},{"text":"One sugar sack had been opened and resealed with tape.","id":"c2"},{"text":"The office cash box was untouched all afternoon.","id":"c3"}],"liarCount":3,"pointsPerCorrect":15,"penaltyPerIncorrect":5,"tieBreak":"none","tieBreakBonus":0,"performers":[{"name":"Sugar Sal","id":"baker","profile":"Runs the candy floss stand.","isLiar":false,"statements":["I never left my stand.","The sugar delivery came at six."]},{"name":"Dusty Jim","id":"courier","profile":"Delivers supplies to every stall.","isLiar":true,"statements":["I delivered the sugar sealed.","I did not open any sacks."]},{"name":"Ink","id":"painter","profile":"Paints the carnival signs.","isLiar":true,"statements":["I only use red and gold paint.","I was painting the horror house all day."]},{"name":"Pip","id":"juggler","profile":"Juggler. Easily distracted.","isLiar":false,"statements":["I saw someone with black hands near the stand."]},{"name":"Doc Mortimer","id":"medic","profile":"Carnival medic.","isLiar":false,"statements":["Nobody was seriously harmed.","The dye was harmless food colouring."]},{"name":"Mister Grin","id":"manager","profile":"Stall manager.","isLiar":true,"statements":["I was counting money in the office.","I have no reason to sabotage Sal."]}],"title":"The Poisoned Candy Floss","rules":"Each performer may be asked one question per investigator per minute. Accusations must be submitted through the hall terminal."}],"defaultMystery":"vanishing_ringmaster","durationSeconds":600,"validationDistance":25.0,"location":{"z":13.15,"y":-1102.0,"x":-1622.0,"w":30.0},"blip":{"sprite":590,"colour":40,"enabled":true},"interactDistance":2.5,"npcModel":"s_m_m_highsec_01"},"shooting":{"maxScore":250,"enabled":true,"blip":{"sprite":313,"colour":1,"enabled":true},"minClickIntervalMs":90,"targetLifetimeMs":2800,"location":{"z":13.15,"y":-1083.0,"x":-1653.0,"w":140.0},"missPenalty":0,"accuracyBonusMax":20,"accurac