eLimit":120,"difficulty":"hard","title":"Operatic Complaint","roles":["Customer","Vendor"]},{"id":"puppet_strings","description":"You are a marionette. The Puppet Master controls your movements by calling out body parts. Tell your life story while obeying.","category":"solo","minPoints":5,"minPlayers":1,"maxPoints":30,"maxPlayers":1,"timeLimit":90,"difficulty":"medium","title":"Cut the Strings","roles":["Marionette"]},{"id":"ghost_interview","description":"A ghost interviews for the role of carnival haunter. The panel is very concerned about its lack of experience.","category":"group","minPoints":5,"minPlayers":2,"maxPoints":30,"maxPlayers":4,"timeLimit":150,"difficulty":"easy","title":"Job Interview for a Ghost","roles":["Ghost Applicant","Panel Chair","HR Representative","Skeptical Ringmaster"]},{"id":"silent_rescue","description":"A rescue team must save a cat from an imaginary tree without making a single sound.","category":"group","minPoints":10,"minPlayers":2,"maxPoints":40,"maxPlayers":6,"timeLimit":120,"difficulty":"absurd","title":"Silent Rescue Team","roles":["Team Leader","Rope Specialist","Medic","The Cat","Ladder","Bystander"]},{"id":"nature_doc","description":"Narrate the mating rituals of the wild carnival-goer while your partner acts it out.","category":"duo","minPoints":10,"minPlayers":2,"maxPoints":30,"maxPlayers":2,"timeLimit":120,"difficulty":"medium","title":"Carnival Nature Documentary","roles":["Narrator","Wild Carnival-Goer"]},{"id":"time_traveller","description":"You have arrived from 1890 and must buy a churro using only Victorian vocabulary.","category":"solo","minPoints":5,"minPlayers":1,"maxPoints":20,"maxPlayers":1,"timeLimit":90,"difficulty":"easy","title":"Time Traveller at the Funfair","roles":["Time Traveller"]},{"id":"cursed_jury","description":"Put the Wheel of Misfortune on trial for crimes against luck. Lawyers, witnesses and a very biased judge.","category":"group","minPoints":15,"minPlayers":3,"maxPoints":45,"maxPlayers":6,"ti